        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>40篇短文背完3500词 - Mark and a Seal</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 30px 25px 40px 25px;\n    color: #111;\n    position: relative;\n    line-height: 2.5;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 15%;\n    right: 15%;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: rgba(150,150,150,0.35);\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n    z-index: -1;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 10px 0 25px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  h2.subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #1a4fd6;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-style: italic;\n    margin: 0 0 25px 0;\n  }\n  p.para {\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  ruby {\n    ruby-position: under;\n    -webkit-ruby-position: after;\n    ruby-align: center;\n  }\n  rt {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    color: #111;\n    font-style: normal;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  ruby.hl {\n    color: #d40000;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  ruby.hl rt {\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .markname {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .circ {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"watermark\">文库</div>\n\n<h1 class=\"title\">40 篇短文背完 3500 词</h1>\n<h2 class=\"subtitle\">一．Mark and a Seal 马克和海豹</h2>\n\n<p class=\"para\">\n<span class=\"circ\">①</span><span class=\"markname\">Mark</span>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">rented<rt>租借</rt></ruby> an\n<ruby class=\"hl\">accommodation<rt>住处</rt></ruby> with his\n<ruby class=\"hl\">pension<rt>养老金</rt></ruby> near the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">shore<rt>海岸</rt></ruby>. He paid\n<ruby class=\"hl\">annual<rt>每年的</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">visits<rt>访问</rt></ruby> there to\n<ruby class=\"hl\">enjoy<rt>享受</rt></ruby> the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">vivid<rt>生动的</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">beauty<rt>美丽</rt></ruby> in the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">depths<rt>深处</rt></ruby> of the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">pure<rt>纯粹的</rt></ruby> sea.\n<span class=\"circ\">②</span>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">Once<rt>有一次</rt></ruby>, with his\n<ruby class=\"hl\">underwater<rt>水下</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">telescope<rt>望远镜</rt></ruby> and\n<ruby class=\"hl\">flashlight<rt>手电筒</rt></ruby>.\n<span class=\"markname\">Mark</span>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">dived<rt>潜</rt></ruby> along the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">boundary<rt>分界线</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">between<rt>在...之间</rt></ruby> the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">steep<rt>陡峭的</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">reef<rt>暗礁</rt></ruby> and the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">area<rt>地区</rt></ruby> of\n<ruby class=\"hl\">seaweed<rt>海草</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">conservation<rt>保护区</rt></ruby>.\n<ruby class=\"hl\">Suddenly<rt>突然</rt></ruby> an\n<ruby class=\"hl\">awesome<rt>令人畏惧的</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">Antarctic<rt>南极的</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">seal<rt>海豹</rt></ruby> with\n<ruby class=\"hl\">sharp teeth<rt>锋利的牙齿</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">appeared<rt>出现</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">opposite<rt>在...对面</rt></ruby>\nhim. Every\n<ruby class=\"hl\">cell<rt>细胞</rt></ruby> in his\n<ruby class=\"hl\">body<rt>身体</rt></ruby> was\n<ruby class=\"hl\">scared<rt>被吓到</rt></ruby> to death. But soon, he was\n<ruby class=\"hl\">aware<rt>察觉到</rt></ruby>\nthat he wasn't the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">target<rt>目标</rt></ruby> of an\n<ruby class=\"hl\">attack<rt>袭击</rt></ruby>. With a\n<ruby class=\"hl\">neat<rt>[?]</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">wound<rt>伤口</rt></ruby> in its\n<ruby class=\"hl\">lip<rt>嘴唇</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">caused<rt>造成</rt></ruby>\nby a\n<ruby class=\"hl\">shark<rt>鲨鱼</rt></ruby>, this\n<ruby class=\"hl\">grey<rt>灰色的</rt></ruby> seal was\n<ruby class=\"hl\">washed<rt>被水冲</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">upside down<rt>头上脚下</rt></ruby> by the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">tides<rt>潮水</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">time after time<rt>时不时地</rt></ruby>. But it tried to\n<ruby class=\"hl\">jog<rt>轻轻碰撞</rt></ruby>\n<span class=\"markname\">Mark</span>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">as if<rt>好像</rt></ruby> to\n<ruby class=\"hl\">urge<rt>催促</rt></ruby> him to\n<ruby class=\"hl\">help<rt>帮助</rt></ruby> it. So\n<span class=\"markname\">Mark</span>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">abandoned<rt>放弃</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">fleeing away<rt>逃跑</rt></ruby>. With its\n<ruby class=\"hl\">teamwork<rt>团队合作</rt></ruby>,\n<span class=\"markname\">Mark</span> used a\n<ruby class=\"hl\">net<rt>网</rt></ruby> to\n<ruby class=\"hl\">drag<rt>拖</rt></ruby> the seal to the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">shallow water<rt>浅水区</rt></ruby>. Without\n<ruby class=\"hl\">pausing<rt>毫不停歇</rt></ruby> he\n<ruby class=\"hl\">helped it out<rt>帮助脱离困境</rt></ruby> after a\n<ruby class=\"hl\">simple<rt>简单的</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">operation<rt>手术</rt></ruby>\nand\n<ruby class=\"hl\">settled<rt>安顿</rt></ruby> it in a\n<ruby class=\"hl\">narrow<rt>狭窄的</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">cave<rt>山洞</rt></ruby> by the\n<ruby class=\"hl\">seaside<rt>海边</rt></ruby>. Every time he\n<ruby class=\"hl\">brought<rt>带来</rt></ruby> it\n<ruby class=\"hl\">tasty<rt>美味的</rt></ruby>\nfish it would yell and\n<ruby class=\"hl\">suck<rt>吸吮</rt></ruby> his\n<ruby class=\"hl\">hands<rt>[?]</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">happily<rt>开心地</rt></ruby>. Witnesses said their\n<ruby class=\"hl\">anecdotes<rt>轶事</rt></ruby>\n<ruby class=\"hl\">reflected<rt>映射</rt></ruby> a magic\n<ruby class=\"hl\">dimension<rt>方面</rt></ruby> of the relationship between\n<ruby class=\"hl\">humans<rt>人</rt></ruby> and\n<ruby class=\"hl\">animals<rt>动物</rt></ruby>.\n</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
